### Test de Endpoints de Audio para Opciones Múltiples

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@characterId = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
@stateId = game_state_001
@interactionIndex = 0
@optionIndex = 0
@token = tu_token_aqui

# ============ POST - Upload Audio de Pregunta de Opción ============

### 1. Subir audio para pregunta de opción
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/{{characterId}}/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/{{optionIndex}}/question/audio/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="question.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test_audio.mp3
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#     "message": "Audio updated successfully",
#     "audio_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/.../option-0-question.mp3",
#     "database_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/.../option-0-question.mp3",
#     "urls_match": true,
#     "updated_at": "2026-02-02T10:30:00",
#     "metadata": {
#         "size": 245760,
#         "format": "mp3"
#     }
# }


# ============ POST - Upload Audio de Respuesta de Opción ============

### 2. Subir audio para respuesta de opción
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/{{characterId}}/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/{{optionIndex}}/answer/audio/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="answer.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test_audio.mp3
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#     "message": "Audio updated successfully",
#     "audio_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/.../option-0-answer.mp3",
#     "database_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/.../option-0-answer.mp3",
#     "urls_match": true,
#     "updated_at": "2026-02-02T10:30:00",
#     "metadata": {
#         "size": 245760,
#         "format": "mp3"
#     }
# }


# ============ DELETE - Eliminar Audio de Pregunta ============

### 3. Eliminar audio de pregunta de opción
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/characters/{{characterId}}/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/{{optionIndex}}/question/audio/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected Response (204):
# No Content


# ============ DELETE - Eliminar Audio de Respuesta ============

### 4. Eliminar audio de respuesta de opción
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/characters/{{characterId}}/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/{{optionIndex}}/answer/audio/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected Response (204):
# No Content


# ============ CASOS DE ERROR ============

### 5. Error - Character ID inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/invalid_id/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/{{optionIndex}}/question/audio/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="question.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test_audio.mp3
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Expected Response (404 o 500):
# {
#     "detail": {
#         "error": "Not Found",
#         "message": "Character not found",
#         "code": "RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND"
#     }
# }


### 6. Error - Option index fuera de rango
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/{{characterId}}/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/999/question/audio/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="question.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test_audio.mp3
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Expected Response (404):
# {
#     "detail": {
#         "error": "Not Found",
#         "message": "Option index out of range",
#         "code": "RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND"
#     }
# }


### 7. Error - Sin autenticación
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/{{characterId}}/state/{{stateId}}/interaction/{{interactionIndex}}/option/{{optionIndex}}/question/audio/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="question.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test_audio.mp3
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Expected Response (401):
# Unauthorized


# ============ NOTAS ============
#
# 1. Reemplaza los valores en las variables:
#    - @token: Tu token de autenticación válido
#    - @characterId: ID válido del personaje
#    - @stateId: ID válido del estado
#
# 2. Para las pruebas locales, asegúrate que:
#    - El backend está corriendo en http://localhost:8000
#    - Tienes un archivo test_audio.mp3 en la raíz
#    - El token es válido y no ha expirado
#
# 3. Los endpoints esperan:
#    - Authorization header con Bearer token
#    - Content-Type: multipart/form-data
#    - Campo "audio" con el archivo
#
# 4. Errores comunes:
#    - 404: Character/State/Option no encontrado
#    - 403: Sin permisos (no eres dueño del juego)
#    - 500: Error interno del servidor
